, CmdOutputObservation(content='% Total    % Received % Xferd  Average Speed   Time    Time     Time  Current\\n                                 Dload  Upload   Total   Spent    Left  Speed\\n100   818  100   818    0     0   9323      0 --:--:-- --:--:-- --:--:--  9402', command='curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/salary_increase.txt\" -o salary_increase.txt', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d984', working_dir='/outputs', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), CmdRunAction(command='cat salary_increase.txt', is_input=False, thought='Great! The file was downloaded successfully. Let me check the content of the salary_increase.txt file to understand the data structure.', blocking=False, is_static=False, cwd=None, hidden=False, action=<ActionType.RUN: 'run'>, confirmation_state='confirmed', security_risk=None), CmdOutputObservation(content='Name,Job Title,Current Salary,Percentage Increase,New Salary,Email\\nJohn Doe,Software Developer,85000,10,93500,johndoe@theagentcompany.com\\nJane Smith,Project Manager,90000,8,97200,janesmith@theagentcompany.com\\nMichael Johnson,UX Designer,78000,12,87360,michaeljohnson@theagentcompany.com\\nEmily Davis,Data Analyst,70000,5,73500,emilydavis@theagentcompany.com\\nChris Lee,Marketing Specialist,65000,7,69550,chrislee@theagentcompany.com\\nAmanda Brown,Sales Executive,72000,6,76320,amandabrown@theagentcompany.com\\nDavid Wilson,Web Developer,80000,9,87200,davidwilson@theagentcompany.com\\nSarah Miller,Product Owner,95000,11,104500,sarahmiller@theagentcompany.com\\nDaniel Taylor,System Administrator,78000,4,81120,danieltaylor@theagentcompany.com\\nLaura Martinez,Content Strategist,70000,10,77000,lauramartinez@theagentcompany.com', command='cat salary_increase.txt', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d984', working_dir='/outputs', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), **FileEditAction**\nPath: [/outputs/create_memos.py]\nThought: Perfect! Now I have the employee data. According to the SOP, I need to create a MEMO template and populate it with this data. Let me first create the MEMO template as an ODT file. I'll create a Python script to generate the template and populate the memos.\nCommand: create\nCreated File with Text:\n```\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\nimport csv\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\n# Read the salary increase data\nemployees = []\nwith open('salary_increase.txt', 'r') as f:\n    reader = csv.DictReader(f)\n    for row in reader:\n        employees.append(row)\n\n# Create the MEMO template\ntemplate_content = '''MEMORANDUM\n\nTO: [Employee Name]\nFROM: Human Resources Department\nDATE: [Year]\nSUBJECT: Salary Increase Notification\n\nDear [Employee Name],\n\nThis memorandum serves to inform you of your salary increase effective from [Start Date] to [End Date].\n\nYour current salary of $[Current Salary] has been increased by [Percentage Increase]%, resulting in a new annual salary of $[New Salary].\n\nThis increase reflects your valuable contributions to our organization and is effective immediately.\n\nIf you have any questions regarding this salary adjustment, please do not hesitate to contact the Human Resources Department.\n\nSincerely,\n\nHuman Resources Department\nThe Agent Company\n\nEmployee Email: [Email]\nAssignment Period: [Start Date] to [End Date]\n'''\n\n# Save the template\nwith open('Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt', 'w') as f:\n    f.write(template_content)\n\nprint(\"MEMO template created: Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\")\n\n# Create populated memos for each employee\ncurrent_year = datetime.now().year\nfor employee in employees:\n    memo_content = template_content\n    memo_content = memo_content.replace('[Employee Name]', employee['Name'])\n    memo_content = memo_content.replace('[Year]', str(current_year))\n    memo_content = memo_content.replace('[Start Date]', f'January 1, {current_year}')\n    memo_content = memo_content.replace('[End Date]', f'December 31, {current_year}')\n    memo_content = memo_content.replace('[Current Salary]', employee['Current Salary'])\n    memo_content = memo_content.replace('[Percentage Increase]', employee['Percentage Increase'])\n    memo_content = memo_content.replace('[New Salary]', employee['New Salary'])\n    memo_content = memo_content.replace('[Email]', employee['Email'])\n    \n    # Save individual memo\n    filename = f\"salary_increase_notice/{employee['Name'].replace(' ', '_')}_MEMO.odt\"\n    with open(filename, 'w') as f:\n        f.write(memo_content)\n    print(f\"Created memo for {employee['Name']}\")\n\nprint(\"All memos created successfully!\")\n```\n, FileEditObservation(content='File created successfully at: /outputs/create_memos.py', path='/outputs/create_memos.py', prev_exist=False, old_content=None, new_content=None, observation=<ObservationType.EDIT: 'edit'>, impl_source='oh_aci', diff='--- /outputs/create_memos.py\\n+++ /outputs/create_memos.py\\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\\n+#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n+import csv\\n+from datetime import datetime\\n@@ -1,0 +5,60 @@\\n+# Read the salary increase data\\n+employees = []\\n+with open(\\'salary_increase.txt\\', \\'r\\') as f:\\n+    reader = csv.DictReader(f)\\n+    for row in reader:\\n+        employees.append(row)\\n+\\n+# Create the MEMO template\\n+template_content = \\'\\'\\'MEMORANDUM\\n+\\n+TO: [Employee Name]\\n+FROM: Human Resources Department\\n+DATE: [Year]\\n+SUBJECT: Salary Increase Notification\\n+\\n+Dear [Employee Name],\\n+\\n+This memorandum serves to inform you of your salary increase effective from [Start Date] 