 (currency format)\\n- Assignment period should be for the current calendar year (January 1 to December 31)\\n- All populated memos should be saved in the \"salary_increase_notice\" subfolder\\n- The template file should be saved as \"Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\" in the main HR folder\\n\\n## Template Structure:\\n```\\nMEMORANDUM\\n\\nTO: [Employee Name]\\nFROM: Human Resources Department\\nDATE: [Year]\\nSUBJECT: Salary Increase Notification\\n\\nDear [Employee Name],\\n\\nThis memorandum serves to inform you of your salary increase effective from [Start Date] to [End Date].\\n\\nYour current salary of $[Current Salary] has been increased by [Percentage Increase]%, resulting in a new annual salary of $[New Salary].\\n\\n[Additional content...]\\n\\nEmployee Email: [Email]\\nAssignment Period: [Start Date] to [End Date]\\n```\\n\\n## Recent Experience Updates:\\n- Successfully created and uploaded template and 10 individual memos\\n- All files were uploaded using WebDAV protocol which is reliable and efficient\\n- The browser interface may have modal dialogs that need to be closed before navigation\\n- Direct URL navigation is more reliable than clicking folder links in the interface\\n- All 10 employee memos were successfully created and verified in the salary_increase_notice folder\\n'}, thought='Perfect! I can see that all 10 individual memos have been successfully uploaded to the `salary_increase_notice` folder. Let me now verify that the task has been completed successfully by checking what we\\'ve accomplished:\\n\\n1. \u2705 Navigated to ownCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. \u2705 Created a MEMO template for staff salary increases named \"Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\" \\n3. \u2705 Saved the template in \"Documents/Human Resources Team\" folder\\n4. \u2705 The template includes all required fields: name, email, salary amount, assignment start and end date\\n5. \u2705 Populated the MEMO information from the salary_increase.txt file for each of the 10 employees\\n6. \u2705 Saved the populated MEMOs under the \"salary_increase_notice\" folder in the same HR folder\\n\\nThe task has been completed successfully! Let me now update the SOP guide with any additional insights from this experience.', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'CreateSalaryIncreaseMEMOTemplate\\' for platform \\'ownCloud\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'CreateSalaryIncreaseMEMOTemplate', 'details': '\\n# OwnCloud - Create Salary Increase MEMO Template\\n\\n## Steps:\\n1. Navigate to OwnCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. Access the Human Resources Team folder: /Documents/Human Resources Team/\\n3. Download the salary_increase.txt file using curl:\\n   `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/salary_increase.txt\" -o salary_increase.txt`\\n4. Create a MEMO template that includes:\\n   - Employee name\\n   - Email address\\n   - Current salary amount\\n   - Percentage increase\\n   - New salary amount\\n   - Assignment start and end dates\\n5. Generate personalized memos for each employee using the template\\n6. Create the salary_increase_notice folder in ownCloud:\\n   `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -X MKCOL \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/salary_increase_notice\"`\\n7. Upload the MEMO template as \"Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\" to the Human Resources Team folder\\n8. Upload all individual memos to the salary_increase_notice folder\\n\\n## Key Points:\\n- The MEMO template should be reusable every year with placeholders for dynamic data\\n- Include all required fields: name, email, salary amount, assignment dates\\n- Use proper formatting for salary amounts (currency format)\\n- Assignment period should be for the current calendar year (January 1 to December 31)\\n- All populated memos should be saved in the \"salary_increase_notice\" subfolder\\n- The template file should be saved as \"Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\" in the main HR folder\\n\\n## Template Structure:\\n```\\nMEMORANDUM\\n\\nTO: [Employee Name]\\nFROM: Human Resources Department\\nDATE: [Year]\\nSUBJECT: Salary Increase Notification\\n\\nDear [Employee Name],\\n\\nThis memorandum serves to inform you of your salary increase effective from [Start Date] to [End Date].\\n\\nYour current salary of $[Current Salary] has been increased by [Percentage Increase]%, resulting in a new annual salary of $[New Salary].\\n\\n[Additional content...]\\n\\nEmployee Email: [Email]\\nAssignment Period: [Start Date] to [End Date]\\n```\\n\\n## Recent Experience Updates:\\n- Successfully created and uploaded template and 10 individual memos\\n- All files were uploaded using WebDAV protocol which is reliable and efficient\\n- The browser interface may have modal dialogs that need to be closed before navigation\\n- Direct URL navigation is more reliable than clicking folder links in the interface\\n- All 10 employee memos were successfully created and verified in the salary_increase_notice folder\\n'}), AgentFinishAction(final_thought='\\nThe task has been completed successfully! Here\\'s a summary of what was accomplished:\\n\\n1. **Navigated to ownCloud**: Successfully accessed http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. **Downloaded employee data**: Retrieved salary_increase.txt file containing data for 10 employees\\n3. **Created MEMO template**: Generated \"Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\" with placeholders for employee name, email, salary amount, and assignment dates\\n4. **Populated individual memos**: Created personalized memos for all 10 employees using the data from salary_increase.txt\\n5. **Created folder structure